{"type":"plan","title":"風鈴の願い","logline":"夏休み、京都の町家で祖母と過ごす少女が、祇園祭の夜に青い短冊を風鈴に結び、静かな奇跡を呼び起こす。","shots":[{"index":1,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Wide shot of the engawa veranda in bright summer morning, shoji doors open onto a green garden; Yui steps onto the wooden floor, Grandma watches from the doorway. Morning, bright sunlight.","mode":"still","dialogue":"夏休み、ゆいは、京都のおばあちゃんの家に、遊びに来ました。","cites":[1,6]},{"index":2,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Medium shot framing the old Edo wind chime hanging from the veranda eaves, its paper strips motionless in the still air; the garden beyond is quiet. Midday, bright sun.","mode":"still","dialogue":"縁側には、古い江戸風鈴が、ひとつ下がっていますが、もう、音が鳴りません。","cites":[1,5]},{"index":3,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Close-up of Grandma's kindly face as she gestures to the chime, soft light catching her eyes; she explains it was bought with Grandpa. Midday, gentle light.","mode":"still","dialogue":"「おじいちゃんと買った風鈴なの」と、おばあちゃんは、言いました。","cites":[1]},{"index":4,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Wide shot of the Gion festival street at dusk, lanterns glowing amber along stalls; Yui and Grandma in yukata walk side by side into the bustling lane. Dusk, lantern glow.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"夕方、二人は、浴衣を着て、祇園祭の宵山へ、出かけました。","cites":[2,4]},{"index":5,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Medium shot panning along the lantern-lit stalls, paper lanterns swaying gently in the evening breeze, crowds suggested by silhouettes. Dusk, lantern glow.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"提灯の灯る通りには、屋台が、ずらりと並んでいます。","cites":[2,4]},{"index":6,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Close-up of Yui's hand picking a blue tanzaku strip from a stall's display, the paper's cool hue vivid against warm lantern light. Dusk, lantern glow.","mode":"still","dialogue":"風鈴の屋台で、ゆいは、青い短冊を、一枚選びました。","cites":[5]},{"index":7,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Medium shot inside the tatami tea-room at night, low table illuminated by a single paper lantern; Yui sits writing on the blue tanzaku, Grandma watches nearby. Night, lantern glow.","mode":"still","dialogue":"夜、家に帰ると、ゆいは、短冊に、願いごとを書きました。","cites":[3]},{"index":8,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Close-up of the blue tanzaku now bearing the handwritten wish in delicate brush strokes, the characters glowing faintly in the dim light. Night, lantern glow.","mode":"still","dialogue":"「おばあちゃんの風鈴が、また、鳴りますように」。","cites":[5]},{"index":9,"shotType":"Medium shot","description":"Medium shot over Yui's shoulder on the veranda at night, she ties the blue tanzaku to the wind chime's lower rod; a gentle night breeze stirs the garden leaves. Night, soft breeze.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"ゆいが、短冊を風鈴に結ぶと、夜風が、そっと吹きました。","cites":[1,5]},{"index":10,"shotType":"Close-up","description":"Close-up of the wind chime as the night wind sets it swaying, the brass rods chiming softly 'chirin', paper strips fluttering. Night, breeze.","mode":"motion","dialogue":"ちりん。風鈴が、ひさしぶりに、鳴りました。","cites":[1,5]},{"index":11,"shotType":"Wide shot","description":"Wide shot of the veranda under starry night, Grandma gently wipes a tear and strokes Yui's head, the wind chime's faint tone lingering. Night, starlight.","mode":"still","dialogue":"おばあちゃんは、そっと涙をふいて、ゆいの頭を、なでました。","cites":[1]}]}
